sequenceDiagram
    participant Customer
    participant Frontend
    participant API
    participant Firestore
    
    Note over Customer,Firestore: Customer's Local Time: 2:00 PM CST
    Note over Customer,Firestore: Store Time: 3:00 PM EST
    
    Customer->>Frontend: Select service (60 min)
    Frontend->>Frontend: Convert to store timezone<br/>(2:00 PM CST → 3:00 PM EST)
    
    Frontend->>API: Check availability for 3:00 PM EST
    API->>Firestore: Query bookings 3:00-4:00 PM EST
    
    alt Slot Available
        Firestore-->>API: No conflicts
        API-->>Frontend: Available ✓
        Frontend->>Customer: Show available slot
    else Slot Occupied
        Firestore-->>API: Existing booking found
        API-->>Frontend: Unavailable ✗
        Frontend->>Customer: Show next available
    end
    
    Customer->>Frontend: Confirm booking
    Frontend->>API: Create booking (3:00 PM EST)
    API->>Firestore: Store in UTC<br/>(8:00 PM UTC)
    
    Note over Firestore: All times stored in UTC<br/>Prevents timezone bugs
